   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "Puts the face from a photo into a new picture with IP-Adapter FaceID Plus v2 (SD 1.5).\nThe input picture is a clear photo of ONE face. Weight = overall face strength; FaceID v2 weight = likeness (1–2).\nLoRA strength (0.6) is the FaceID LoRA the loader adds automatically.\nFace fix: the faces are found and redrawn sharper at the end (Impact Pack FaceDetailer; Fix faces denoise 0.35: lower keeps the face closer, 0 / bypass to skip).\n\nModel: SD 1.5 checkpoints (realistic or anime). Default: Realistic Vision 6.\nDefaults: 30 steps, CFG 6.5, ddpm / karras."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
